{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric Narrative</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3961950/extras/754d94a000375d1acf9112d04b3e8c3f.avif?t=1756301333\" width=1520 height=844 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a deeply emotional, story-driven journey, told through evocative visuals, haunting music, and subtle environmental storytelling.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong></strong><br><strong>Chill Yet Engaging Combat</strong><br>Experience a simple but weighty combat system that flows naturally with exploration\u2014keeping the tension without overwhelming you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Variety of Weapons</strong><br>Wield an arsenal of weapons, from close-range melee tools to ranged firearms, to fend off the shadowy figures lurking in Yus\u2019s mind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Mind Like No Other</strong><br>Step into an environment shaped entirely by Yus\u2019s thoughts\u2014a place where reality twists, logic bends, and nothing is quite what it seems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Puzzles with Purpose</strong><br>Within this surreal world lie mysterious puzzles\u2014even Yus himself doesn\u2019t understand them. Solve them to uncover secrets and help him confront his deepest fears.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3961950?t=1756301333","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3961950?t=1756301333","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3961950/c9e7656868aa13e0cbc1543713e5f4f5c0986705/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756301333","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3961950/c9e7656868aa13e0cbc1543713e5f4f5c0986705/capsule_1